        "title": "The template handler has script fields and nothing else",
        "observation": "In github://mikemartinez1974/public/templates/edge-class-template/root.node, the node \"Sync label to demo view\" (type event-handler) has the data keys scriptName, source, allowMutations, dryRun, autoRun, autoRunOnLoad, autoRunOnGraphChange, scriptId, scriptRef, lastResult, and lastRunAt. It has no trigger, condition, or declared-effects field. The trigger exists only on a separate Subscription node whose handlerNodeId points at it.",
